Design a circuit that implements both a convolutional encoder and a Viterbi decoder. The module takes an n-bit input, processes it through a convolutional encoder that generates m-bit encoded output based on specific polynomial functions of the input bits, and subsequently utilizes a Viterbi decoding algorithm to decode the encoded output back to the original bitstream. The output of the module is the decoded bit sequence.
